34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We are all still here. Now we must decide if we need to execute someone today.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh, nobody got eaten yet? Wait, the wolf attacks at night! We have to be careful!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I have information. Kenji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That was a very direct claim. Are you the Seer?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Toshio, that's a lie! I'm not the wolf! Why would you say that?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, if you are the Seer, you've made the game very short. Are you certain?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, right out of the gate! Kenji, are you really the wolf? You look so shocked!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Kenji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a bold move. If Toshio is lying, he is likely the Possessed or the Wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm not! Toshio is just trying to trick you all! Please don't believe him!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If Toshio is the wolf, he's trying to eliminate a villager by faking the Seer role.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But Toshio seems so serious! I think he's telling the truth!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I have no reason to lie. Executing Kenji now ensures our victory.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The logic is simple: if Toshio is the Seer, Kenji dies. If Toshio is the wolf, we lose a villager.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
