49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I trust Toshio's decisiveness in this instance. The evidence is his claim.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for Kenji! Sorry, Kenji!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let us end this now.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
